USAID Saved Millions of Children Worldwide on a (relative) Shoestring Budget

Some facts:

Since 2000, the global rate of children dying before their fifth birthday has been cut nearly in half. (world in data) 

USAID is particaly responsible for this positive development: From 2000 to 2021, USAID saved an estimated 30 million children under five (Lancet)

USAID funding is less than 1% of the USA budget.


